  unitName: Flame Legend Vargas
  unitId: 10016
  unitNumber: 801
  description: Along with his friend's wings, Vargas headed towards the center of
    the battle against the gods only to find a young girl who hated humans running
    rampant in the forest. He defeated the girl while still wounded, later regretting
    having taken her life even after all the damage she had caused. At that moment
    a knight appeared before him, leading to an intense duel in which Vargas would
    obtain powers greater than those of a god. However, after hearing the knight
    speak he stopped fighting back, losing his life to the blade that struck him
    as he smiled. With no one to defend it, the Agni empire began to crumble after
    this hero's death.
  summonDesc: My life's just a small price to pay.<br>My will shall burn forever<br>to
    light the future of the people!
  fusionDesc: Burn, Dandelga!<br>Set my soul ablaze,<br>and reduce all our enemies
    to ashes!
  evoDesc: God, human, it doesn't matter!<br>I'll keep growing stronger to protect<br>everything
    precious to me!
  element: 1
  rarity: 6
